          "end_sec": 1388.0,
          "text": "萆 说个屁 我跟他有什么好说的",
          "text_sha256": "443dc8d9d6b1a0ef2519d612a4ba0c31dd0ed78545021a9038306964869e3a9e"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1388.0,
          "end_sec": 1389.0,
          "text": "说个屁 我跟他有什么好说的",
          "text_sha256": "25550b237d14722197abadaf0f4c3842ddf1b84b849c15fe5c62b3a3efd7e8b5"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1390.0,
          "end_sec": 1391.0,
          "text": "人我给你带来了",
          "text_sha256": "ba76f60b88379f30821c523f642a22d3a7eaae1a65e615c3b769f23929c9eaef"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1397.0,
          "end_sec": 1398.0,
          "text": "已：",
          "text_sha256": "5c7984db634500631291fbd0ef20326e146179d062aa07ec64a4766787b3bdc4"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1398.0,
          "end_sec": 1399.0,
          "text": "晚秋说你找我",
          "text_sha256": "e9cfe15d7d4d9fdcc231cd9873e7e47cbc63636e7ce6500faa9c4d61fb8480be"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1400.0,
          "end_sec": 1402.0,
          "text": "是这样 这个晚上",
          "text_sha256": "d4a8f07c24fd841851071b2a0ae8b7d95eede08993977a83d788770503d9d410"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1402.0,
          "end_sec": 1405.0,
          "text": "你家先生回来就别做饭了",
          "text_sha256": "2bdc531224a4e3401a95d1c4a05d389224e599d2b2d4d4d013088cc20473e29e"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1405.0,
          "end_sec": 1406.0,
          "text": "在我家吃吧",
          "text_sha256": "0dba664a834619798366df5132c9130553ec06166b2473c4d3cc84bacc13390d"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1408.0,
          "end_sec": 1409.0,
          "text": "这当然好啊",
          "text_sha256": "72dec3d473118737ea693ef4f32174edf91cc89d760c8fca5cb6f7fddca72eea"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1412.0,
          "end_sec": 1413.0,
          "text": "怎么吃啊 家里只有半张烙饼",
          "text_sha256": "148c0f7975c409e605bed1a5ad4a87e73a33c74af6c5b305dc1998673ae39c42"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1413.0,
          "end_sec": 1414.0,
          "text": "怎么吃啊；家里只有半张烙饼",
          "text_sha256": "d0e02177fc28bc9e629fc1ec8f2b4399ca60185f9a5347cda0ec8ec45e1a6a05"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1414.0,
          "end_sec": 1415.0,
          "text": "怎么吃啊，家里只有半张烙饼",
          "text_sha256": "6283beabc5d6f3b06b657a7e9870da30612c7448bdc1309b79270061ae8ebd52"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1415.0,
          "end_sec": 1417.0,
          "text": "这你就别操心了",
          "text_sha256": "4838d0a0e0c0a84916f7d555cde3b2cc8116826f048762718fc0ff6c6736b4f7"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1418.0,
          "end_sec": 1419.0,
          "text": "我一会儿让人送个锅子来",
          "text_sha256": "299d3d6a19501f51a17f49621eb2c82abe4ee0480ed75abbc02601ecdf915f55"
        },
        {
